        <p>
          <span class="font-[700]">Uberto Barbini:</span><span class> It can work. The point is always to make the LLM </span><span class="font-[700]">aware</span><span class> of the design. If you have a layered design, the LLM needs to be aware of it, which means it needs to be in the prompt or in the file content.</span><!---->
        </p>
